{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ponshot is an illegally popular street sport, born from an obsession with movement and throwing things in style. It\u2019s played on rooftops, streets, bridges\u2014anywhere you can run, jump, and cause trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no fixed rules. Just athletes with unique abilities, street fame\u2026 or a pure love for disaster by dodgeball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoying playing in a chaotic universe with street urban stylized visuals, authentic characters, balls with crazy physics, witty announcer and many game modes for endless fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COUCH CAOS</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing with your friends in the local multiplayer up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends in the practice field to be a professional poncher.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/ec5e1e2f95135d6d1f9de92b76562597.poster.avif?t=1768620354\" width=606 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/ec5e1e2f95135d6d1f9de92b76562597.webm?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/ec5e1e2f95135d6d1f9de92b76562597.mp4?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVE LIKE A NINJA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the street with speed and style using dynamic acrobatic parkour - inspired movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/4a2e9271d81f83b4296d13270c622e4e.poster.avif?t=1768620354\" width=606 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/4a2e9271d81f83b4296d13270c622e4e.webm?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/4a2e9271d81f83b4296d13270c622e4e.mp4?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT FOR THE BALL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >intercept shots, hit players, steal the ball and throw ball strikes that can change the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/b27d12615cf221c0defd7798e289efd3.poster.avif?t=1768620354\" width=606 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/b27d12615cf221c0defd7798e289efd3.webm?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/b27d12615cf221c0defd7798e289efd3.mp4?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash Everything:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim, charge and shoot powerful ball strikes that destroy all in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/ced2da629253ae3ce7734dcef7f81b4f.poster.avif?t=1768620354\" width=606 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/ced2da629253ae3ce7734dcef7f81b4f.webm?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/ced2da629253ae3ce7734dcef7f81b4f.mp4?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS DRIVEN MAYHEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With chaotic ball physics, flying objects, and unpredictable environments, every match is a glorious mess of mayhem, narrated by a sarcastic announcer who never misses a bad bounce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/3dfb073c96fcefcac5e511daa15bcbca.poster.avif?t=1768620354\" width=606 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/3dfb073c96fcefcac5e511daa15bcbca.webm?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/extras/3dfb073c96fcefcac5e511daa15bcbca.mp4?t=1768620354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU READY FOR THE COMPETITION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAKE THE BALL AND ADD IT TO YOUR WHISLIST!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793920?t=1768620354","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/2c6bd0a06fcc55f54f711b5fbe1da816958d4c38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768620354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/ae1a8c1da2d38066ecd0ec599c4c2f3a54e5de91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768620354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793920/ae1a8c1da2d38066ecd0ec599c4c2f3a54e5de91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768620354","categories":[{"descripti